<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Python - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/Python/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/Python/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to install a package from Github that has other github dependencies ?</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/How-to-install-a-package-from-Github-that-has-other-github-dependencies/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Aug 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/How-to-install-a-package-from-Github-that-has-other-github-dependencies/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;最近在开发&lt;code&gt;ApiTestEngine&lt;/code&gt;时遇到一个安装包依赖的问题，耗费了不少时间寻找解决方案，考虑到还算比较有普遍性，因此总结形成这篇文章。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="从-pip-install-说起"&gt;&lt;span&gt;从 pip install 说起&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e4%bb%8e-pip-install-%e8%af%b4%e8%b5%b7" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;先不那么简单地描述下背景。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>使用 pyenv 管理多个 Python 版本依赖环境</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/use-pyenv-manage-multiple-python-virtualenvs/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Mar 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/use-pyenv-manage-multiple-python-virtualenvs/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;从接触Python以来，一直都是采用&lt;a href="https://virtualenv.pypa.io/en/stable/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;virtualenv&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://pypi.python.org/pypi/virtualenvwrapper" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;code&gt;virtualenvwrapper&lt;/code&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;来管理不同项目的依赖环境，通过&lt;code&gt;workon&lt;/code&gt;、&lt;code&gt;mkvirtualenv&lt;/code&gt;等命令进行虚拟环境切换，很是愉快。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台（3）：编写iOS自动化测试脚本</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;通过前面三篇文章，我们已经将iOS自动化功能测试的开发环境全部准备就绪，也学习了iOS UI控件交互操作的一般性方法，接下来，就可以开始编写自动化测试脚本了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android App持续集成性能测试：使用Python实现UI自动化</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-UI-Automation-with-Python/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-UI-Automation-with-Python/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在进行Android App持续集成性能测试的时候，需要自动化实现UI层面的一些操作，常见的几种场景包括：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;测试帧率时，需要模拟滑屏、拖拽操作；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;初次安装app后启动应用时，需要点击按钮跳过协议页面；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;从&lt;code&gt;Android M&lt;/code&gt;(6.0)开始，首次启动应用时会进行系统权限校验，需要勾选checkbox以及点击按钮；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;模拟点击按钮登录用户账号；&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;这些场景虽然看上去互不相关，但是从测试的角度，UI层面的操作应该都可以归为两类：控件定位和执行动作。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Python 的函数式编程 -- 从入门到⎡放弃⎦</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/python-functional-programming-getting-started/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/python-functional-programming-getting-started/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;很早以前就听说过了函数式编程，印象中是一种很晦涩难懂的编程模式，但却一直没有去进行了解。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;恰好这周组内的周会轮到我主持，一时也没想到要分享什么。灵光一闪，就选定函数式编程这个主题吧，反正组里的同事都没有学过，只需要讲解入门方面的知识就好，也正好可以借这个机会逼迫自己去学习下这种新的编程方式。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>利用 PyCharm 进行 Python 远程调试</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/remote-debugging-with-pycharm/</link><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/remote-debugging-with-pycharm/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;有时候Python应用的代码在本地开发环境运行十分正常，但是放到线上以后却出现了莫名其妙的异常，经过再三排查以后还是找不到问题原因，于是就在想，要是可以在服务器环境中进行单步跟踪调试就好了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>